9. The t-SNE analysis is underdeveloped

The t-SNE visualization is used to motivate domain shift and validation/test splits. However:
- the feature extractor is ViT-B/16, not SAM ViT-H;
- t-SNE can be sensitive to hyperparameters;
- the figure reference contains an error: “Fig. ??”;
